flowchart TD
  S([Start]) --> R[Register / log in]
  R --> F[Select degree programme]
  F --> D[Select department & level]
  D --> U[Upload required documents<br/>NID, birth certificate, credentials]
  U --> SUB[Submit application]
  SUB --> CK{Open application<br/>already exists?}
  CK -->|Yes| ERR[Reject: one open application at a time]
  CK -->|No| ST[Store files, create application<br/>status = Submitted]
  ST --> RO[Auto-assign Applicant role + audit]
  RO --> E([Await SAO decision])
  ERR --> E2([End])
